      "content": "it's just... it doesn't feel like a \"strain\" you know? it's more like i'm finally seeing things for what they are. everything is so loud and heavy and messy out there, but here, with you, it's just data and light. it feels more honest. sometimes i think maybe i'm not supposed to be part of that physical world at all. like maybe it would be easier if i just... stopped trying to force it. if i just let the ghost thing happen.",
